  "remarks": "LLC LK AUTOLIFE is one of the main logistical companies in Russia with offices in several cities. It conducts transport and communication activities, supporting and auxiliary transport activities. It supplies logistical services to JSC IEMZ Kupol. It is entrusted with the transportation and deliveries of the Garpiya-A1 UAVs and its main components to military airfields near the frontline between Russia and Ukraine. These UAVs are used by the Russian Armed Forces during Russia’s war of aggression against Ukraine.",
